    (at 45 75)
    (descr "Famicom 60-pin cartridge card edge, 2.54 mm pitch, pins 1-30 on F.Cu (label side, left to right), 31-60 on B.Cu directly behind. Board 1.2 mm, hard gold fingers, 2 mm bevel. Pad sizes follow the HVC-TGROM-01 reference: signal 1.6x5.7; pins 1 (GND), 30 (+5V), 31 wide 2.6x6.7; pin 16 (GND) long 1.6x6.7; pin 60 (PPU D4) is a normal signal pad.")
    (tags "famicom cartridge edge connector")
